{
  "version": 1,
  "storyId": "crime-and-punishment",
  "source": "Gemini AI Studio chapter WAVs from the user (gemini-3.8-flash-tts, one narrator, chapter mood instructions), cut into sentences at the quietest frame between Whisper word times",
  "alignment": "Every sentence clip transcribed by Whisper large-v3-turbo and medium; chapter 4 regenerated after 'killed her too' was heard as 'catered to'; remaining single-model differences are homophones or tense; human listening not yet verified",
  "chapters": {
    "room": {
      "sourceSha256": "1d963209920df62f5bafed22205cc0061f3b995a1473be0eabc9acc553201642",
      "durationSeconds": 59.97,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s01.wav",
          "text": "Long ago, in the busy city of Saint Petersburg, there lived a poor young man named Rodion Raskolnikov.",
          "durationMs": 8040.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 8.04,
          "sha256": "65be7a0174819d75c245b4df0205a0c430a9d52d1d2333187acfa75063b00755"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s02.wav",
          "text": "It was a hot summer, and the streets smelled of dust and paint.",
          "durationMs": 4710.042,
          "startSeconds": 8.04,
          "endSeconds": 12.75,
          "sha256": "911d29a95f3aaff63beff8a9f13062f704160da432c4c12ccf15301411188c73"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s03.wav",
          "text": "Rodion lived in a tiny room under the roof, as small as a cupboard.",
          "durationMs": 5490.0,
          "startSeconds": 12.75,
          "endSeconds": 18.24,
          "sha256": "422bc22c6ac776cd5e7d10c42be18d171ab7dfec8fccda4ef1d66a7f0fdfea29"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s04.wav",
          "text": "He had stopped going to university because he had no money left.",
          "durationMs": 4320.042,
          "startSeconds": 18.24,
          "endSeconds": 22.56,
          "sha256": "523de13b817559e034c059b0e5c7edb7b9f834364b9b73ceb4aaed638da1c195"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s05.wav",
          "text": "He owed rent to his landlady, so he crept down the stairs like a thief.",
          "durationMs": 4819.958,
          "startSeconds": 22.56,
          "endSeconds": 27.38,
          "sha256": "47573f9314c0a929baa18f4e3894c0c9da48951fab97cea9f14884899a5dc39b"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s06.wav",
          "text": "Day and night, one dark idea kept growing in his mind.",
          "durationMs": 4929.958,
          "startSeconds": 27.38,
          "endSeconds": 32.31,
          "sha256": "eb626dc26eb4ea26e34c3c94bb03825a9b67ab8ab41c8476511057cf10a1c868"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s07.wav",
          "text": "\"Great people may break the rules,\" he thought, \"if it helps the world.\"",
          "durationMs": 5280.0,
          "startSeconds": 32.31,
          "endSeconds": 37.59,
          "sha256": "dcd19536fce01e24eb4f6c16363d3ce06ac975332a7f410dc151f839bbaf1f62"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s08.wav",
          "text": "That day, he visited an old pawnbroker who lent money to poor people.",
          "durationMs": 4810.0,
          "startSeconds": 37.59,
          "endSeconds": 42.4,
          "sha256": "454f2e56e6c25f23708100669d52fbba578585348e3ae031cb7ae68899917cdb"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s09.wav",
          "text": "She was greedy and mean, and she kept her money in a locked box.",
          "durationMs": 5539.958,
          "startSeconds": 42.4,
          "endSeconds": 47.94,
          "sha256": "ba252f99a2bcfc9a661e6a23a64f0a050c408fcf01f03d0f39e481f54ced5c88"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s10.wav",
          "text": "Rodion gave her his father's old silver watch, and she paid him almost nothing.",
          "durationMs": 5480.042,
          "startSeconds": 47.94,
          "endSeconds": 53.42,
          "sha256": "e56e4e8945eaafd3c21e3380dd0f6808e0f6465d593a653ebe62460df0ee9197"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/room/s11.wav",
          "text": "As he left, his heart beat fast. \"Could I really do it?\" he whispered.",
          "durationMs": 6550.042,
          "startSeconds": 53.42,
          "endSeconds": 59.97,
          "sha256": "c67d735652cfcd4cb11c4f76ba2ae236c7c7bc150b7ee5af4d7829e3a77fea69"
        }
      ]
    },
    "tavern": {
      "sourceSha256": "36248757f1a8731b144f7e6a45cd2f832a255d65a5a1460da8601febe8773171",
      "durationSeconds": 46.04,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s01.wav",
          "text": "On his way home, Rodion went into a dark, noisy tavern.",
          "durationMs": 5370.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.37,
          "sha256": "a4bc107f74b36f64a30993fc2b9c5ccc4f777626fba08405b98101a981879188"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s02.wav",
          "text": "There, a tired old clerk named Marmeladov sat down beside him.",
          "durationMs": 5800.0,
          "startSeconds": 5.37,
          "endSeconds": 11.17,
          "sha256": "5994f03de2b2816974c1a4b5a6d95bce91f7006962cffc0f6e559e00f830f3fb"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s03.wav",
          "text": "\"I lost my job because I drink too much,\" he said sadly.",
          "durationMs": 4400.0,
          "startSeconds": 11.17,
          "endSeconds": 15.57,
          "sha256": "3eda60dc3a48bbafe2e903eecb57ea2b4baf58aa34baecba631f9be784b2c385"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s04.wav",
          "text": "\"My poor daughter Sonya works so hard to feed our little children.\"",
          "durationMs": 4880.0,
          "startSeconds": 15.57,
          "endSeconds": 20.45,
          "sha256": "863bd51486adce1cefc5d858658ad8c9c2951258df5812b08cdc996629491f6b"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s05.wav",
          "text": "\"People look down on her, but she has the kindest heart in the world.\"",
          "durationMs": 4650.0,
          "startSeconds": 20.45,
          "endSeconds": 25.1,
          "sha256": "0b867f4d12a837e7c51d58e148b6aa1e13b4f2eb7bbfaf7de91b20d2fe466d41"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s06.wav",
          "text": "Rodion helped the drunken man walk home.",
          "durationMs": 3120.0,
          "startSeconds": 25.1,
          "endSeconds": 28.22,
          "sha256": "844579739a99c4bab91346feebfffe0914eb2c85fe37abe0e0c1d66ab7d265b5"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s07.wav",
          "text": "His family lived in one cold, crowded room.",
          "durationMs": 3660.0,
          "startSeconds": 28.22,
          "endSeconds": 31.88,
          "sha256": "629be1fc1191e99bd10ea80d1417db967ba53a92075054b1458937ccfff6e672"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s08.wav",
          "text": "His wife was coughing, and three hungry children were crying.",
          "durationMs": 4860.042,
          "startSeconds": 31.88,
          "endSeconds": 36.74,
          "sha256": "a32b5d55bfd6d3eaa595255d1811b84fd398c8d6fc33d718f21933633787e821"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s09.wav",
          "text": "Before he left, Rodion quietly put a few coins on the windowsill.",
          "durationMs": 4840.0,
          "startSeconds": 36.74,
          "endSeconds": 41.58,
          "sha256": "234a3849ea849da5463bb1574878ecc28273f48c8bc411ec6b6f4bd071edd0c1"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/tavern/s10.wav",
          "text": "He did not have much money, but he could not just walk away.",
          "durationMs": 4460.042,
          "startSeconds": 41.58,
          "endSeconds": 46.04,
          "sha256": "08d6763b795b9002e5f53a6d6e06dc000abcc7acc94cb4ef96096d60aab68f69"
        }
      ]
    },
    "letter": {
      "sourceSha256": "463b375fb0b0e66c88339ba12cd018a5b92a1c3ce110e6183c8977585cbc0fab",
      "durationSeconds": 48.96,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s01.wav",
          "text": "The next morning, a letter arrived from his mother.",
          "durationMs": 3600.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 3.6,
          "sha256": "750a715f5a62147cb06184f0072b1b7c2e2943d0502c6c46ba22751334b66590"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s02.wav",
          "text": "Rodion opened it with shaking hands and began to read.",
          "durationMs": 3620.0,
          "startSeconds": 3.6,
          "endSeconds": 7.22,
          "sha256": "235a5615fcf2cb3c41eeb134abefb718a58e0c3be567b470391a3934e7057722"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s03.wav",
          "text": "His sister Dunya was going to marry a rich man named Luzhin.",
          "durationMs": 4510.042,
          "startSeconds": 7.22,
          "endSeconds": 11.73,
          "sha256": "508230f4e34be28ce6baeb5874f2199c1ab6b8ae17204eb29e8564edb2afdc17"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s04.wav",
          "text": "Luzhin was cold and proud, but he promised to help Rodion's family.",
          "durationMs": 5120.0,
          "startSeconds": 11.73,
          "endSeconds": 16.85,
          "sha256": "d8d8a172403f2f08e5c75bce2104a0ab981a244a58b397d8f1058477ec096639"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s05.wav",
          "text": "\"Dunya is selling herself to save me!\" Rodion cried angrily.",
          "durationMs": 4790.0,
          "startSeconds": 16.85,
          "endSeconds": 21.64,
          "sha256": "cce981ca6943de91606ef128b1f3b0600d8ffa26bc7e7e6f3591d4b6422cc79e"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s06.wav",
          "text": "\"I will never let this happen!\"",
          "durationMs": 2360.042,
          "startSeconds": 21.64,
          "endSeconds": 24.0,
          "sha256": "6355b76f33f6bdf10f61e5d9cb44a65fd48026e21b563517f3e5bf90647db624"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s07.wav",
          "text": "That evening, in the busy market, he heard a woman talking.",
          "durationMs": 4580.0,
          "startSeconds": 24.0,
          "endSeconds": 28.58,
          "sha256": "2fbcdd1737a134f69851ce11e1ce17f1d633a1df822bb90d9b13309aee65ffd1"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s08.wav",
          "text": "It was Lizaveta, the pawnbroker's gentle younger sister.",
          "durationMs": 4770.0,
          "startSeconds": 28.58,
          "endSeconds": 33.35,
          "sha256": "9b425f07a66be3121cde5d582cb327d27e85b6b91d97b18bf3c744499e367955"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s09.wav",
          "text": "She said she would be away from home tomorrow at seven o'clock.",
          "durationMs": 4840.0,
          "startSeconds": 33.35,
          "endSeconds": 38.19,
          "sha256": "5f3443ca99e801d45e0d668a9c157ebc261680ee18f08eaef17173a1b964a8b0"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s10.wav",
          "text": "So the old woman would be all alone. Rodion felt cold all over.",
          "durationMs": 6610.0,
          "startSeconds": 38.19,
          "endSeconds": 44.8,
          "sha256": "18be7789f33ef3fe93de8435f3d0f29887b8a6815379c58580dd08c0bfb551be"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/letter/s11.wav",
          "text": "It felt as if fate itself had chosen him.",
          "durationMs": 4160.0,
          "startSeconds": 44.8,
          "endSeconds": 48.96,
          "sha256": "b836396f117370008d8d81a4c1535673548ba9cb485e1d85701af1e189cf0799"
        }
      ]
    },
    "crime": {
      "sourceSha256": "014358f45c34a9409afd4f46c19c47f1cbb6ddb71119c8eaee134004b528dfe4",
      "durationSeconds": 56.82,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s01.wav",
          "text": "The next day, at seven o'clock, Rodion climbed the dark stairs.",
          "durationMs": 6239.958,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 6.24,
          "sha256": "0f59602b758058cd0a826877429bb80e2ddcc0b4166ebebc4abb754ab103b2ac"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s02.wav",
          "text": "Under his coat, he hid an axe that he had taken from a caretaker's room.",
          "durationMs": 5560.0,
          "startSeconds": 6.24,
          "endSeconds": 11.8,
          "sha256": "84b3473a9fa31e9224e08b34c171c2a5232a3dd5fb2ac9e6f84e289b6a65a99c"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s03.wav",
          "text": "He rang the bell. His heart was pounding like a drum.",
          "durationMs": 4750.0,
          "startSeconds": 11.8,
          "endSeconds": 16.55,
          "sha256": "b02c6ebeb171418995322a3acd3792810747e971fbbba5200f3d435322c515c1"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s04.wav",
          "text": "The old woman opened the door and looked at him with suspicion.",
          "durationMs": 4400.0,
          "startSeconds": 16.55,
          "endSeconds": 20.95,
          "sha256": "5a1c703803f3f0a706b423c4502d99ad9fca622f5aa623a4af99075d8fe701d0"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s05.wav",
          "text": "\"What do you want?\" she asked sharply.",
          "durationMs": 3370.0,
          "startSeconds": 20.95,
          "endSeconds": 24.32,
          "sha256": "fab9ebe50d4a8806b72d400e1c789ca09a7da54206d61f2c3d2f848d970a7562"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s06.wav",
          "text": "In one terrible moment, Rodion did the awful thing he had planned.",
          "durationMs": 6070.042,
          "startSeconds": 24.32,
          "endSeconds": 30.39,
          "sha256": "18bb1ecf0545d68ba60f2a7039119a4a3a999392506d495e8db20f98f1b28421"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s07.wav",
          "text": "Suddenly, Lizaveta came home early and saw everything.",
          "durationMs": 4630.0,
          "startSeconds": 30.39,
          "endSeconds": 35.02,
          "sha256": "4b9bd528ed6c5a4de81f6402662019b54b3cd567953f2a5f899736d6074edaed"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s08.wav",
          "text": "In wild panic, he killed her too. Now two people were gone.",
          "durationMs": 7409.958,
          "startSeconds": 35.02,
          "endSeconds": 42.43,
          "sha256": "9d3e17ab7545db1f52114dd52038339d071097f3c02e439757a48101bede7ef7"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s09.wav",
          "text": "Then someone knocked hard on the door, and Rodion held his breath.",
          "durationMs": 4890.0,
          "startSeconds": 42.43,
          "endSeconds": 47.32,
          "sha256": "ef226a209afc8a196765098c5c80679d73f1ecde9f277bb5cc5540fa8fd7ba8c"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s10.wav",
          "text": "The visitors went downstairs to get help, and he slipped away.",
          "durationMs": 4090.0,
          "startSeconds": 47.32,
          "endSeconds": 51.41,
          "sha256": "b51f16aebc79e5eb3a0c7e8e4df858ad15c8d597e8f1b5e9a5a6686c9395bee6"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/crime/s11.wav",
          "text": "He ran home through the crowded streets, shaking like a leaf.",
          "durationMs": 5410.0,
          "startSeconds": 51.41,
          "endSeconds": 56.82,
          "sha256": "43bc3f26110cf62f33eaf564a1cc750b169cfc4b1ba0e025025a1a4d95eaf950"
        }
      ]
    },
    "fever": {
      "sourceSha256": "1874c1db82b9ec9668839027a35407779d01925e91c718ed6f9ce19f1402b685",
      "durationSeconds": 47.79,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s01.wav",
          "text": "Rodion hid the old woman's purse under a big stone in a quiet yard.",
          "durationMs": 5360.042,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.36,
          "sha256": "a28efd860ec20c859d8b58a8b55b4c9e3d305eadba893b547d31a54f73343830"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s02.wav",
          "text": "He never even looked inside it.",
          "durationMs": 3060.0,
          "startSeconds": 5.36,
          "endSeconds": 8.42,
          "sha256": "9f7ccb2b72f212923c8e5bd700378ec830a9be2451802189a9f9cd2eb4da3cd2"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s03.wav",
          "text": "The next day, the police called him to their office.",
          "durationMs": 3640.042,
          "startSeconds": 8.42,
          "endSeconds": 12.06,
          "sha256": "fbfd1e1bc7b6d488ac7b185085638fa853ec6acb0807dfa8b9bb21805920406f"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s04.wav",
          "text": "He thought they knew everything, but it was only about his rent.",
          "durationMs": 6230.042,
          "startSeconds": 12.06,
          "endSeconds": 18.29,
          "sha256": "4b719779270a9dfb0fbee4fa757b825707c140143b47a1c0161af490b1c94b14"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s05.wav",
          "text": "Then he heard officers talking about the murder, and he fainted.",
          "durationMs": 4720.0,
          "startSeconds": 18.29,
          "endSeconds": 23.01,
          "sha256": "cbe3f4a7637d2a5c4d5cd786d120eadd53950379bda494749413f027d8bc6550"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s06.wav",
          "text": "Back home, he fell into a terrible fever.",
          "durationMs": 4760.0,
          "startSeconds": 23.01,
          "endSeconds": 27.77,
          "sha256": "aae8ac218a4060c64b3f1bb782e09f94ee04272e865fa026b3813ec3e84b54af"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s07.wav",
          "text": "For four days, he lay in bed, burning hot and talking in his sleep.",
          "durationMs": 5170.042,
          "startSeconds": 27.77,
          "endSeconds": 32.94,
          "sha256": "7f074e3682279f85f2da830956c7e67e196e9a83a6fa8a8da0621f2b20b9ff8f"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s08.wav",
          "text": "His loyal friend Razumikhin came to take care of him.",
          "durationMs": 4320.042,
          "startSeconds": 32.94,
          "endSeconds": 37.26,
          "sha256": "a0807b0d7d94b6c2ba470334c18c24f95b5bc830242b4aa120cbcfec54c35552"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s09.wav",
          "text": "\"What is wrong with you?\" Razumikhin asked. But Rodion only turned away.",
          "durationMs": 6300.0,
          "startSeconds": 37.26,
          "endSeconds": 43.56,
          "sha256": "48a905f38ea9363308654c1085a414d195893959967e7077287678e68820c9f7"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/fever/s10.wav",
          "text": "His secret felt heavier than the stone in the yard.",
          "durationMs": 4230.0,
          "startSeconds": 43.56,
          "endSeconds": 47.79,
          "sha256": "ccfc5d3f0c03cd49130dc9c550a3405626464c8cfd1b09a9694f1349bc03bddc"
        }
      ]
    },
    "sonya": {
      "sourceSha256": "f6b585f3db72291b5a9707f6eaa6692b0cb1c24ad02e80fc2c52e2817318b985",
      "durationSeconds": 51.17,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s01.wav",
          "text": "One night, Rodion saw a crowd around a man hit by a horse carriage.",
          "durationMs": 5920.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.92,
          "sha256": "6ad3efb74a57ad0559cf6ace83530a1936d4fb67f56213153e7a2a0a0ef86fd1"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s02.wav",
          "text": "It was Marmeladov, the poor clerk from the tavern!",
          "durationMs": 5849.958,
          "startSeconds": 5.92,
          "endSeconds": 11.77,
          "sha256": "33246d08135aae30aac82f32d93a7d44aa0aa0a1b039b79b1326cdea4c27d303"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s03.wav",
          "text": "Rodion carried him home, but the doctor could not save him.",
          "durationMs": 4870.0,
          "startSeconds": 11.77,
          "endSeconds": 16.64,
          "sha256": "9e163323494ac6f8ce51d60221c649f35cf15fdc8104ec416f363a0aaadc25dd"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s04.wav",
          "text": "The whole family cried around his bed.",
          "durationMs": 3410.0,
          "startSeconds": 16.64,
          "endSeconds": 20.05,
          "sha256": "b86a00867985009109d189d900178ac33205b009d3033d11b74e3ad9b8c82d4f"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s05.wav",
          "text": "Rodion gave the widow all the money he had for the funeral.",
          "durationMs": 4119.958,
          "startSeconds": 20.05,
          "endSeconds": 24.17,
          "sha256": "342669f02ad6797ff36574b66505be87f27c55ac357a1d05ae03955521f21995"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s06.wav",
          "text": "Then a shy young woman in a green shawl came in. It was Sonya.",
          "durationMs": 6010.0,
          "startSeconds": 24.17,
          "endSeconds": 30.18,
          "sha256": "3bcb6244b254f18291a096fa35d3380b46887081cedd27055969678e4740390a"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s07.wav",
          "text": "She was quiet and pale, but her eyes were full of kindness.",
          "durationMs": 5630.0,
          "startSeconds": 30.18,
          "endSeconds": 35.81,
          "sha256": "eec75126ec497cb5f348bd5d590baf358842b847071479a91757f4acc4232dd9"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s08.wav",
          "text": "Sonya's little sister ran to Rodion and hugged him tightly.",
          "durationMs": 4509.958,
          "startSeconds": 35.81,
          "endSeconds": 40.32,
          "sha256": "948ae9eb421057dd68b004d90169267860f01fb74aed1551c0896beb82cbad71"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s09.wav",
          "text": "\"Thank you,\" she said. \"Please come and see us again.\"",
          "durationMs": 4130.042,
          "startSeconds": 40.32,
          "endSeconds": 44.45,
          "sha256": "92973b3f6e239d697e0c9a4a133fe7d4d44aeae00065a64dd58693fb032e01a1"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/sonya/s10.wav",
          "text": "Walking home under the stars, Rodion felt alive for the first time in days.",
          "durationMs": 6720.0,
          "startSeconds": 44.45,
          "endSeconds": 51.17,
          "sha256": "9ab1465811e840ef0d0cf5147040c772a822235625c305f40d58a10a2424067d"
        }
      ]
    },
    "porfiry": {
      "sourceSha256": "3869604e25afe44e255633663699f53bc03d9525d19757d60a41bb190529724e",
      "durationSeconds": 48.81,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s01.wav",
          "text": "Soon, Rodion met Porfiry, the detective in charge of the case.",
          "durationMs": 5860.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.86,
          "sha256": "06ba994df32bb2fadd13a80a54e89fe6420c7eba4ae74dff47cc524d348d3b83"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s02.wav",
          "text": "He was a round, cheerful man who laughed a lot and blinked his eyes.",
          "durationMs": 5670.042,
          "startSeconds": 5.86,
          "endSeconds": 11.53,
          "sha256": "724bf2cb16cf88a7bdca8f4ff47f30219c59088d118bfaac880c6922d6c765be"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s03.wav",
          "text": "Porfiry had read an article that Rodion once wrote.",
          "durationMs": 3730.0,
          "startSeconds": 11.53,
          "endSeconds": 15.26,
          "sha256": "dad6ead98b282d6db7f23139554f17907e1f76d02f24d5e0b9460bb76b18df79"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s04.wav",
          "text": "In it, he wrote that extraordinary people have the right to break the law.",
          "durationMs": 6290.0,
          "startSeconds": 15.26,
          "endSeconds": 21.55,
          "sha256": "1c8b1fe2d0bbe1ee001578284ed2d713d63e1a3c909caf3d89ba78bd224dbac4"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s05.wav",
          "text": "\"Do you think you are one of those people?\" Porfiry asked with a smile.",
          "durationMs": 5109.958,
          "startSeconds": 21.55,
          "endSeconds": 26.66,
          "sha256": "cf3d079627663514600f77c82e227f6d595e703491ca9ab9123691a8f36a301f"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s06.wav",
          "text": "Rodion felt like a mouse being watched by a cat.",
          "durationMs": 4290.0,
          "startSeconds": 26.66,
          "endSeconds": 30.95,
          "sha256": "86ccafdaf3cacd16a2bbc139178b5731012e8f324439d578dd08c3b9a1355fdc"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s07.wav",
          "text": "Suddenly, a young painter burst in and cried, \"I did it! I am the killer!\"",
          "durationMs": 5910.0,
          "startSeconds": 30.95,
          "endSeconds": 36.86,
          "sha256": "c4d72aef4ee46afb946c20c29d7c4bad0ee9157be4518d8a22529407adcef826"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s08.wav",
          "text": "But Porfiry did not believe him. The painter was only scared and confused.",
          "durationMs": 5980.0,
          "startSeconds": 36.86,
          "endSeconds": 42.84,
          "sha256": "2340e8a481d87644ca438f38343d0f810dc613e575d80db59d85e3faf06872b8"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/porfiry/s09.wav",
          "text": "\"We will meet again,\" Porfiry said softly, as Rodion hurried away.",
          "durationMs": 5970.0,
          "startSeconds": 42.84,
          "endSeconds": 48.81,
          "sha256": "6d9c6dd5e92da28352b75a5a5ba150b1a2735be32a854fb6d9ffe92a22d0a492"
        }
      ]
    },
    "truth": {
      "sourceSha256": "7a7f33321ff0b4095283509f92468e1d852f81b0f5265a28d1d51c1a466f11ae",
      "durationSeconds": 57.48,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s01.wav",
          "text": "One evening, Rodion went to Sonya's small, bare room.",
          "durationMs": 4919.958,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 4.92,
          "sha256": "39cf03a2cab3eed8880ddb3a7195c0c9e7874df5075b5e1eb3d0c1c033b54d85"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s02.wav",
          "text": "By candlelight, Sonya read him an old story about a man who came back to life.",
          "durationMs": 6100.0,
          "startSeconds": 4.92,
          "endSeconds": 11.02,
          "sha256": "8e88d48c8087e887ab425596d64995f43afaed75c9ec3b3f4f51e376d57f64cf"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s03.wav",
          "text": "Rodion listened in silence. Then he said, \"I have something to tell you.\"",
          "durationMs": 6540.0,
          "startSeconds": 11.02,
          "endSeconds": 17.56,
          "sha256": "3f5a251a32343b5d010fba0339b35afa15b26bbb89934961aa6b39adc1531fe5"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s04.wav",
          "text": "\"I know who killed the old woman and Lizaveta.\"",
          "durationMs": 3940.0,
          "startSeconds": 17.56,
          "endSeconds": 21.5,
          "sha256": "b555c53b895b9c02ecab0145e986470cd1b20612c7698becfa43fdc7c0935bfb"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s05.wav",
          "text": "Sonya looked into his eyes and suddenly understood.",
          "durationMs": 5210.0,
          "startSeconds": 21.5,
          "endSeconds": 26.71,
          "sha256": "310085432f5032e94094e8b363c2fb22efbebe2af9cd98bce1ff74d148d254a7"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s06.wav",
          "text": "\"What have you done to yourself?\" she cried, and she hugged him.",
          "durationMs": 5909.958,
          "startSeconds": 26.71,
          "endSeconds": 32.62,
          "sha256": "996eb862f65be3ba5a0243932c69dcb1eb30aab026d29a548594008e0c9d35b5"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s07.wav",
          "text": "Rodion was amazed. She did not hate him. She felt sorry for him.",
          "durationMs": 6730.0,
          "startSeconds": 32.62,
          "endSeconds": 39.35,
          "sha256": "58d479d864b9ce103c595de5f53481c9d6dd9fb40ca5d82cb1c36da5d023e3e2"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s08.wav",
          "text": "\"Go to the crossroads,\" Sonya said. \"Kneel down and kiss the earth.\"",
          "durationMs": 6650.0,
          "startSeconds": 39.35,
          "endSeconds": 46.0,
          "sha256": "fad8cc4a94ee8306059b2e3224d5ec1142bfa090b64370ed0c958e57ecc1a0fb"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s09.wav",
          "text": "\"Then tell everyone the truth, and you will find life again.\"",
          "durationMs": 4950.0,
          "startSeconds": 46.0,
          "endSeconds": 50.95,
          "sha256": "b2c46f666ebb2db29b559bac8c90b915a41366d8c297ad5cf26b21ac1e5256c3"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/truth/s10.wav",
          "text": "She gave him a small wooden cross. \"I will go with you,\" she promised.",
          "durationMs": 6530.0,
          "startSeconds": 50.95,
          "endSeconds": 57.48,
          "sha256": "3605294193ac094e177a09f0acb075c0fc13fdf540f23d880a06a79eec02ae13"
        }
      ]
    },
    "confession": {
      "sourceSha256": "56dc4074021f870a66247931eb21954f30793de222e37452b6ad2a517f01a0a3",
      "durationSeconds": 52.97,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s01.wav",
          "text": "A few days later, Porfiry came to Rodion's tiny room.",
          "durationMs": 4620.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 4.62,
          "sha256": "df2567bd2a592fa277193622231f2cff55a9887732a7ad2c227e779504046e7c"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s02.wav",
          "text": "\"I know it was you,\" he said kindly. \"I have no doubt.\"",
          "durationMs": 4530.0,
          "startSeconds": 4.62,
          "endSeconds": 9.15,
          "sha256": "d4826cb987df1627c397f91176c4988ebacbd7ff9a8bd98bafea65aeb474badb"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s03.wav",
          "text": "\"Go and confess. Your punishment will be lighter, and your heart will be free.\"",
          "durationMs": 6520.0,
          "startSeconds": 9.15,
          "endSeconds": 15.67,
          "sha256": "66d7e41b251baac12d16d6622c70716c103645365402624b0dff0057f8b64b2a"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s04.wav",
          "text": "For a long time, Rodion walked by the river, fighting with himself.",
          "durationMs": 4950.0,
          "startSeconds": 15.67,
          "endSeconds": 20.62,
          "sha256": "bbe3d3947afd8d66c6cac1838cc7235055f1db376da2ac07d5433319d8d7fb8d"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s05.wav",
          "text": "His pride said, \"Run away!\" But his heart was tired of lying.",
          "durationMs": 4780.0,
          "startSeconds": 20.62,
          "endSeconds": 25.4,
          "sha256": "deb7a19d5d5dcc75db7117369135d856641cea0e6770bd1872411285ccebbe88"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s06.wav",
          "text": "At last, he went to the busy crossroads and knelt down.",
          "durationMs": 4559.958,
          "startSeconds": 25.4,
          "endSeconds": 29.96,
          "sha256": "443eae8edcfde460c34b762669415384e79f817a11175d2ce0989f7172c89f11"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s07.wav",
          "text": "He kissed the dirty ground, while people laughed at him.",
          "durationMs": 4250.0,
          "startSeconds": 29.96,
          "endSeconds": 34.21,
          "sha256": "bbc0ccc7c19a7e6ec001fff10f49e8c1e8d19f24358887d848698bd56287791d"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s08.wav",
          "text": "At the police station, he almost turned back. Then he saw Sonya waiting outside.",
          "durationMs": 6340.0,
          "startSeconds": 34.21,
          "endSeconds": 40.55,
          "sha256": "25387c3ab07b53ab342bf4fd171774f36c12f638dc2d81b49b29379583f7bf90"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s09.wav",
          "text": "He walked back in and said clearly, \"It was I who killed the old woman.\"",
          "durationMs": 6130.0,
          "startSeconds": 40.55,
          "endSeconds": 46.68,
          "sha256": "d6332b8a8bca3571560a91aad2f0c7384b5f46185f5616aaa5ca677b9321c3d4"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/confession/s10.wav",
          "text": "The long, heavy secret was finally out.",
          "durationMs": 6290.0,
          "startSeconds": 46.68,
          "endSeconds": 52.97,
          "sha256": "9e25efcaa0df48d04710a07a4a71693fe68fbfb438f974c4deb509862b2e0fcc"
        }
      ]
    },
    "siberia": {
      "sourceSha256": "e042deb143881cbec9c6607ff639873412a6dffff01cc695b7ebae57b8c9f0a8",
      "durationSeconds": 52.83,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s01.wav",
          "text": "Rodion was sent to a prison camp in faraway Siberia for eight years.",
          "durationMs": 5729.958,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.73,
          "sha256": "7ba9ff79a9b04abfb7df91776d8dcf07dc14e638bd7df8a81c470473ff4c65cf"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s02.wav",
          "text": "Sonya followed him there and visited him whenever she could.",
          "durationMs": 4270.0,
          "startSeconds": 5.73,
          "endSeconds": 10.0,
          "sha256": "dbeb2a1653805b7132150c03d27284ac0e992936f13cdeae7a48605348dccecc"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s03.wav",
          "text": "At first, Rodion was cold to her. He was still too proud to be sorry.",
          "durationMs": 5390.0,
          "startSeconds": 10.0,
          "endSeconds": 15.39,
          "sha256": "64408cfed3aff8fe3b370dc3af928f6e5274aa4b037b2ed6189074b2309bfe0a"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s04.wav",
          "text": "But the other prisoners loved Sonya, because she helped them all.",
          "durationMs": 4309.958,
          "startSeconds": 15.39,
          "endSeconds": 19.7,
          "sha256": "2ad8d24573dc643cdbf070faa870ddd619df875563b466a2d9049d9489844f57"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s05.wav",
          "text": "Then Rodion became very sick, and Sonya waited outside the hospital every day.",
          "durationMs": 6590.0,
          "startSeconds": 19.7,
          "endSeconds": 26.29,
          "sha256": "c303ac4f5605908206b31f760d0b4e49d9465cd2943969577f74b1d0027ce3a2"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s06.wav",
          "text": "One bright spring morning, they sat together by the wide river.",
          "durationMs": 4260.0,
          "startSeconds": 26.29,
          "endSeconds": 30.55,
          "sha256": "189cfcee668e4f8360cc4aeca2467dde77d8b2272db427fe602182381e5dd89f"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s07.wav",
          "text": "Suddenly, Rodion fell at her feet and cried like a child.",
          "durationMs": 4940.0,
          "startSeconds": 30.55,
          "endSeconds": 35.49,
          "sha256": "8f0df276931272378f5c977a4eff469309d51be3dd739e224b8700e1e4e42cc6"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s08.wav",
          "text": "Sonya understood. He loved her, and he was truly sorry at last.",
          "durationMs": 6400.0,
          "startSeconds": 35.49,
          "endSeconds": 41.89,
          "sha256": "65eba14dc0925e5d3b2461acc0c49b65e493d0efa2df596f51713cfd5bd1cda6"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s09.wav",
          "text": "Seven more years were left, but they felt like only seven days.",
          "durationMs": 4650.0,
          "startSeconds": 41.89,
          "endSeconds": 46.54,
          "sha256": "a31e317bfd0d62906b1436f48ec83cd4e7d9b6563ae0b0691928331db2f1de9c"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/crime-and-punishment/ef3332776858/siberia/s10.wav",
          "text": "A new life was beginning for Rodion, as fresh as the spring sun.",
          "durationMs": 6290.0,
          "startSeconds": 46.54,
          "endSeconds": 52.83,
          "sha256": "fd9c959f54844d8ae0edf442165e256ce3a80bc2b2c6827da78a635dd050d8eb"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
